repository-code: https://github.com/XjunLi/DuetRNA
abstract: >-
  DuetRNA is a full-pipeline research framework for unconditional,
  length-controlled joint generation of RNA sequences and three-dimensional
  heavy-atom structures using coupled base and sugar SE(3) frames. The code
  release includes preprocessing, training, checkpoint resume, generation,
  and evaluation, while excluding datasets, weights, and run artifacts.
keywords:
  - RNA design
  - RNA structure generation
  - flow matching
  - geometric deep learning
  - SE(3)
